<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.34 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2006 bond yields 6.34 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/96 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     18-04-2006</p>
<p> COUPON:				 7.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.34 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  106.10</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 2,066 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 2,576 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>After this auction, the outstanding amount is 22,806 million markka.</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 1,458 million markka at a price of 109.35 and a yield of 5.89 percent.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
